  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CSO Programme - Multiannual Action Plan 2025-2027 - Action Document 4 - DG INTPA Support Measures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support measures under this Action will reinforce efficiency, performance and impact of the thematic programme implementation. These measures will allow for monitoring, audit and evaluation activities, as well as other relevant activities directly linked to the achievement of the thematic programme&#xbf;s specific objectives, such as studies, meetings and consultations, exchanges of best practices, networking, training, information sessions.This action document frames the use of support measures, as envisaged in Article 24 of the Regulation (EU) 2021/947 establishing the Neighbourhood, Development and International Cooperation Instrument - Global Europe and in the Multiannual Indicative Programme for Civil Society Organisations 2021-2027.The objectives of this action will be achieved through services contracts directly managed by the competent European Commission services. This is justified by the nature of the activities (trainings, studies, events, evaluations or audits).</narrative>
  </description>
